OL,3,GNEWSAPost Office closure plan
OL,4,A'disappointing', says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe planed closure of Scarborough's
OL,7,Fmain post office in the coming months
OL,8,Fis "disappointing", the town's MP has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe Post Office confirmed its branch
OL,12,Finside the TG Jones store on
OL,13,FWestborough would close shortly before
OL,14,Fthe store itself was shut as part of a
OL,15,Fwider restructuring programme.
OL,17,FThe town's Labour MP Alison Hume has
OL,18,Furged the Post Office to find an
OL,19,Falternative location for this "vital
OL,20,Flifeline" to be found.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
