OL,3,GNEWSAPost Office closure plan
OL,4,A'disappointing', says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Post Office said a final closure
OL,7,Fdate had not yet been confirmed and
OL,8,Fthat it was reviewing applications from
OL,9,Fpotential operators, meanwhile the
OL,10,FFalsgrave Road and Newlands Park
OL,11,Fbranches had been identified as
OL,12,Falternative locations while a permanent
OL,13,Freplacement was found.
